cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in published work, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Gao
    given-names: Feng
title: "clinstats: Clinical Research Statistics Toolkit"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/gflab/clinstats"
abstract: >-
  Statistical utilities for clinical and translational research, including
  ROC summaries, odds ratios, Cox and logistic regression tables, survival
  cut points, resampling-based Cox screening, TCGA clinical extraction,
  expression-matrix cleaning, and curated public colorectal cancer clinical
  datasets.
